-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-aa7eff76-e375-4f98-b9ee-042e12b3ca98\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c40c1679-7747-49ec-b816-cb7d62b50faf\">서민금융쪽으로 가야 맞는건지..</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d0d0f2ac-823d-4e83-9abb-3d77d34c8a4f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-683b0de4-1e9c-4684-8b7c-3254bcba501d\">아래는 카톡온내용입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-36ba6544-fe31-4ec4-ab69-05cbb0eee023\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e93bd3dc-7798-456c-8eb1-8be4b409b0be\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c642f0f5-e45e-48a0-87e4-feb95bf4a69e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-97cec183-80aa-43b3-b4ec-9b5cda617f66\">&#x27;서민금융진흥원 대신 상환이라고 ***님. 안녕하십니까, 햇살론 대출 보증기관 서민금융진흥원입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4fad639a-ff12-4887-a7a2-9236d787fa52\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1200ef13-aa2a-4232-aa27-a858bf3a8bd7\">전북은행 여신관리부으로부터 받으신 햇살론을 2024년 11월 20일자 보증기관인 서민금융진흥원이 대신 상환하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e950ba4a-6437-4e8b-8b06-d6adb7f18eb9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f16201e6-a4e1-48a4-a7c5-25714fac1d28\">향후 새출발기금 지원 절차에 따라 업무 처리 될 예정입니다&quot;</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-973bc01f-5ee1-46f8-9a62-2a2d940936ca\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-01ac34de-dc12-4fde-a4bb-af88ac8fa333\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-